    <string name="about_title">About the app</string>
    <string name="about_p1">PLNA Smart Check helps you keep all your purchases in one place.</string>
    <string name="about_p2">Take a photo of a receipt or pick an older photo from your gallery. The app reads the store, items, and total for you.</string>
    <string name="about_p3">Everything is saved on your phone first, then sent to the cloud. So your receipts stay safe even without internet.</string>
    <string name="about_p4">You get a personal 16-digit number — your key. Tap it in Profile to copy. Keep it safe: with this number you can open the same receipts on another phone.</string>
    <string name="about_p5">No email or phone number needed. Just a name (or a random one) and your 16-digit ID.</string>
